============================================================
BATCH B5 DAMAGE / PENALTY / INVENTORY CONDITION
============================================================

Status:
- Future batch.
- Do not mix with B1 or B4.

Principle:
- Damage/penalty and inventory movement are different.
- RoomFacility.condition may change when room item is damaged.
- InventoryMovement only happens when physical stock changes.

Forbidden now:
- Do not add damage model in B1.
- Do not modify inventory movement logic in B1.

